  "description": "<div>This is the data and matlab code to prepare the figures for the manuscript \"Feedback gains modulate with motor memory uncertainty\" by Sae Franklin and David Franklin.</div><div><br></div><div>The three main programs to obtain the analysis are:</div><div>df_analyze_RJ_channeltrials.m</div><div>df_analyze_RJ_fieldtrials.m</div><div>df_analyze_RJ_visualpert.m<br></div><div><br></div><div>which will generate each of the figures in the results section of the manuscript. <br></div><div><br></div><div>Data files (.mat) are found within the datafiles.zip</div><div>Additional code is found within helpfunctions.zip<br></div>",
